      "Assist with procedures (e.g., bronchoscopy or tracheostomy) to clear/maintain open airway .",
      "Keep environment allergen free (e.g., dust, feather pillows, or smok e) according to indi vidual situation. Nursing Priority No. 2. To mobilize secretions:",
      "Mobilize the client as soon as possible. This r educes risk or effects of atelectasis, enhancing lung expansion and drainage of differ ent lung segments.",
