      "Nursing Priority No. 1. To assess causative/contributing factors:",
      "Discuss pathophysiology present and/or situation affecting the indi vidual and refer to additional NDs as appropriate. F or example, when alteration in body image is related to neuro-logical defi cit (e.g., cerebrovascular accident—CV A), refer to ND Unilateral Neglect; in the presence of severe, ongoing pain, refer to ND chronic Pain; or in loss of sexual desire/ability, refer to ND Sexual Dysfunction.",
