      "Help the client develop problem- solving skills. Lear ning the pr ocess for problem- solving will promote successful resolution of potentially stressful situations that arise. Nursing Priority No. 3. To promote optimum wellness:",
      "Discuss predisposing factors related to any individual’s response to stress. Understanding that genetic infl uences, past experiences, and existing conditions determine whether a person’ s response is adaptive or maladaptive will give the client a base on which to continue to learn what is needed to improve life.",
