      "Document the presence of factors affecting dentition (e.g., chronic use of tobacco, cof fee, or tea; b ulimia/chronic vomiting; abscesses; tumors; braces; bruxism [chronic grinding of teeth]) to determine possible interventions and/or treatment needs.",
