      "Refer to parenting classes, individual and family therapy and or psychiatric counseling, as indicated. Additional help will enable family to cope with pr oblems in more positive ways.",
      "Suggest participation in group or community activities, e.g., asserti v eness classes, volunteer work. Involvement with others in these activities helps individuals to learn new ways of coping with problems in their own family."
