      "Investigate health problems, unexpected outbreaks or accel-eration of illness, and health hazards in the community . Identifying specifi c problems allows for population-based interventions emphasizing primary prevention, promoting health, and preventing problems before they occur. Cur-rent available resources provide a starting point to deter-mine needs of the community and plan for future needs.",
      "Evaluate strengths and limitations of community healthcare resources for wellness, illness, or sequelae of illness. Knowledge of curr ently available resources and ease of access provide a starting point to determine needs of the com-munity and plan for future needs.",
