      "Determine areas of confl ict among members of community . Cultural or religious beliefs, values, social mores, and lack of a shared vision may limit dialogue or creative problem-solving if not addressed.",
      "Ascertain effect of related factors on community. Issues of safety , poor air quality , lack of education or information, and lack of suffi cient healthcare facilities affect citizens and how they view their community—whether it is a healthy, positive environment in which to live or lacks adequate healthcare or safety resources.",
