      "Nursing Priority No. 1. To identify causative/contributing factors:",
      "Determine whether client has acute or chronic illness; if chronic, note comorbidities and assess the comple xity of care needs. These factors affect ho w the client views and manages self-care. The client may be overwhelmed, in denial, depressed, or have complications exacerbating care needs. Furthermore, people tend to become passive and dependent in long-term, debilitating illnesses and may fi nd it diffi cult to expend energy to follow through with therapeutic regimen.",
