      "Monitor heart rate and rhythm. Dysrh ythmias and electr ocardiogram (ECG) changes are common due to electrolyte imbalance, dehydration, specifi c action of cat-echolamines, and direct effects of hyperthermia on blood and cardiac tissue.",
