      "Schedule voiding for every 2 to 3 hr. Encourage the client to resist ignoring the ur ge to urinate or ha ve a bowel movement. Emptying the bladder on a regular schedule or when feeling an urge reduces the risk for incontinence. Because the urge to void may be diffi cult to differentiate from the urge to defecate, advise the client to respond to the urge.",
