      "Identify or refer to medical equipment suppliers to customize client’ s wheelchair and accessories (e.g ., side guards, head rests, heel loops, brake extensions, tool packs) and electronics suited to client’s ability (e.g., sip and puff, head movement, sensitive switches).",
