    "name": "Classifications NOC/NIC NOC—Caregiver Role Endurance NOC—Caregiver Stressors NIC—Caregiver Support bathing, dressing, feeding, toileting SELF - CARE DEFICIT",
    "category": "Hygiene",
    "subjective": [],
