      "Encourage keeping a journal of progress and practic-ing of independent li ving skills to f oster self-care and self-determination.",
      "Review safety concerns. Modify activities or environment to reduce risk of injury and pr omote successful community functioning.",
      "Refer to home care provider, social services, physical or occu-pational therap y , rehabilitation, and counseling resources, as indicated.",
