    "name": "situational low SELF-ESTEEM and risk for situational low SELF-ESTEEM Diagnostic Studies Medications Pediatric/Geriatric/Lifespan situational low SELF - ESTEEM and risk for situational low SELF - ESTEEM",
    "category": "Ego Integrity",
