      "Discuss and role play, as necessary, ways to deal with alterna-tiv e view or confl ict that may occur with family/signifi cant",
      "Provide bibliotherapy, list of relevant resources (e.g., study groups, parish nurse, poetry society), and possible W eb sites for later reference or self-paced learning and ongoing support."
