      "Identify required changes in lifestyle, occupation, or environment necessitated by limitations imposed by condition or to av oid causative factors.",
      "Refer to community or governmental resources, as indicated (e.g., Public Health Department, Occupational Safety and Health Administration [OSHA], American Burn Association)."
