      "Decrease in or absence of peripheral pulses; ankle-brachial index <0.90; decrease in blood pressure in extremities; femoral bruit Alteration in skin characteristics [e.g., color, elasticity, hair, moisture, nails, sensation, temperature] Skin color pales with limb elevation; capillary refi ll time >3 seconds; color does not return to lowered limb after 1 min leg elevation Decrease in pain-free distances achieved in the 6-min walk test; distance in the 6-min walk test below normal range Edema Alteration in motor function Delay in peripheral wound healing"
